Let $X$ be a continuous random variable with pdf

$$
f(x)=\begin{cases}
2x^{-2}, & 1<x<2 \\
0, & \text{elsewhere}
\end{cases}
$$

Find expectation $E(X)$ and variance $V(X)$.

Suppose that the two-dimensional continuous random variable $(X, Y)$ has the joint pdf given by

$$
f(x,y)=\begin{cases}
x^2+\dfrac{xy}{3}, & 0\le x\le 1,\quad 0\le y\le 2 \\
0, & \text{elsewhere}
\end{cases}
$$

Find the conditional Probability $P(Y<1/2\mid X\le 1/2)$.
